{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026VqVkwMK6v21792749246.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>德國總統施泰因邁爾，將於下周二至六國事訪問中國。</p><p></p><p>施泰因邁爾訪華期間，國家主席習近平會與他會談，就中德雙邊關係和共同關心問題交換意見。除了北京外，施泰因邁爾還會訪問安徽省。</p><p></p><p>外交部表示，中方願同德方以此訪為契機，鞏固互信、深化合作，推動中德關係取得更大發展，助力中歐關係行穩致遠，為世界注入更多正能量。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:48.695111+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T07:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T12:38:06.351179+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:19.690577+00:00","content_hash":"18bd2bc2bd9ddffc3832efc473213f8133341c8759740e2df030d30b1a0817cb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:48.695111+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}